          "It inspects outer SEQUENCE tags (0x30), TBSCertificate headers, Validity dates (UTCTime / GeneralizedTime), and SubjectPublicKeyInfo records using direct read-only memory pointers. The public key point Q is extracted directly into register buffers without allocating a single byte of dynamic heap memory!"
