        "example": "Think of a mail delivery slot in your front door. The slot is physically sized to accept standard envelopes up to 10 inches wide (strict MTU bounds). If a suspicious delivery van tries to push a 6-foot wide wooden shipping crate through the slot (a 65KB malformed packet designed to blow out your door frame), the physical metal flap simply refuses to open.",
